  "content": "<h5><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/worlds/kimetsu-no-yaiba-storymap\" rel=\"nofollow\">地圖連結(Map link)</a></span><br><br></strong></span><span style=\"color:#333\">這個模組包包含一系列模組，旨在讓你在《鬼滅之刃》的世界中進行故事時，獲得更加沉浸式的體驗。它帶領你從一個弱小的劍士成長為柱，或從一個弱小的鬼成長為上弦，直到你有足夠的力量擊敗鬼王無慘。</span><br><span style=\"color:#333\">此外，還有一個自訂NPC模組，如果你搭配我的地圖遊玩將會很有用，可以讓你體驗自訂任務以及跟隨《鬼滅之刃》動畫劇情的故事線。<strong><br></strong></span><br><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Português:</span><br></strong><span style=\"font-weight:400\">Modpack tem um conjunto de mods que fará uma experiência mais imersiva para o progresso de uma história no mundo de Kimetsu no Yaiba. Fazendo você ir de Slayer fraco a Hashira ou de Oni fraco a Lua Superior até que tenha força o bastante para derrotar o Muzan, o Rei dos Onis.<strong><br></strong>Além disso tem mod de Custom Npc que só será útil caso jogue o meu mapa junto para que tenha acesso as missões customizadas e uma história contando o decorrer do Anime Kimetsu no Yaiba.<br><br></span><strong>模組製作Credit：<br><span style=\"color:#333\"><em><a style=\"color:#333\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advancement-plaques\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Advancement Plaques [Neo/Forge]<br></span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a style=\"color:#333\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/alexs-mobs\" rel=\"nofollow\">Alex's Mobs<br></a></span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a style=\"color:#333\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ambientsounds\" rel=\"nofollow\">AmbientSounds 6<br></a><a style=\"color:#333\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/appleskin\" rel=\"nofollow\">AppleSkin<br></a></span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a style=\"color:#333\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/architectury-api\" rel=\"nofollow\">Architectury API (Fabric/Forge/NeoForge)<br></a></span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a style=\"color:#333\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/balm\" rel=\"nofollow\">Balm<br></a></span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a style=\"color:#333\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-advancements\" rel=\"nofollow\">Better Advancements<br></a></span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a style=\"color:#333\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/blockui\" rel=\"nofollow\">BlockUI<br></a></span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a style=\"color:#333\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bookshelf\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bookshelf<br></a></span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a style=\"color:#333\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/citadel\" rel=\"nofollow\">Citadel<br></a></span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a style=\"color:#333\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/clumps\" rel=\"nofollow\">Clumps<br></a></span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a style=\"color:#333\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/coins-je\" rel=\"nofollow\">Coins JE<br></a></span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a style=\"color:#333\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/construction-wand\" rel=\"nofollow\">Construction Wand<br></a></span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a style=\"color:#333\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/creativecore\" rel=\"nofollow\">CreativeCore<br></a></span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a style=\"color:#333\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/curios\" rel=\"nofollow\">Curios API (Forge/NeoForge)<br></a></span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a style=\"color:#333\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/domum-ornamentum\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Domum Ornamentum<br></span></a></span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a style=\"color:#333\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/enhancedvisuals\" rel=\"nofollow\">EnhancedVisuals<br></a></span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a style=\"color:#333\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fog\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fog<br></a></span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a style=\"color:#333\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ftb-library-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\">FTB Library (Forge)<br></a></span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a style=\"color:#333\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/iceberg\" rel=\"nofollow\">Iceberg [Neo/Forge]<br></a></span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a style=\"color:#333\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/demonslayer\" rel=\"nofollow\">Kimetsu no Yaiba (Demon Slayer)<br></a></span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a style=\"color:#333\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lock-on\" rel=\"nofollow\">Lock On<br></a></span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a style=\"color:#333\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lootr\" rel=\"nofollow\">Lootr (Forge &amp; NeoForge)<br></a><a style=\"color:#333\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mru\" rel=\"nofollow\">M.R.U<br></a></span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a style=\"color:#333\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mmmmmmmmmmmm\" rel=\"nofollow\">MmmMmmMmmMmm (Target Dummy)<br></a></span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a style=\"color:#333\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/selene\" rel=\"nofollow\">Moonlight Lib<br></a></span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a style=\"color:#333\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/rpg-hud\" rel=\"nofollow\">RPG-Hud [Forge]<br></a></span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a style=\"color:#333\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sophisticated-backpacks\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sophisticated Backpacks<br></a></span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a style=\"color:#333\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sophisticated-core\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sophisticated Core<br></a></span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a style=\"color:#333\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/structurize\" rel=\"nofollow\">Structurize<br></a></span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a style=\"color:#333\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/unbreakable-enchantment-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\">Unbreakable Enchantment (FORGE)<br></a></span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a style=\"color:#333\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/wall-jump-txf\" rel=\"nofollow\">Wall-Jump TXF<br></a></span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a style=\"color:#333\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/waystones\" rel=\"nofollow\">Waystones<br></a><a style=\"color:#333\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/yacl\" rel=\"nofollow\">YetAnotherConfigLib</a></span></em></span></strong></h5><div style=\"width:0px\">&nbsp;</div><div style=\"width:0px\">&nbsp;</div><div style=\"width:0px\">&nbsp;</div><div style=\"width:0px\">&nbsp;</div><div style=\"width:0px\">&nbsp;</div><div style=\"width:0px\">&nbsp;</div><div style=\"width:0px\">&nbsp;</div><div style=\"width:0px\">&nbsp;</div>",
